## Conventions in one line

Strict TS, React 18, Tailwind v4 utility classes, semantic HTML, test colocated under `src/test/`, knowledge persisted in `wiki/`. Product motion we add is forced for every visitor (do not gate HeroBook3D enter/hover on `prefers-reduced-motion`) — `wiki/conventions/forced-product-motion.md`. Prelaunch quality bar: international standard; beat current webtoon sites on layout, information, and UI/UX; incomplete client data is not a reason to ship a thin page — `wiki/conventions/prelaunch-quality-bar.md`. Catalog: mock when `VITE_USE_MOCK_API` is not `false` (Vercel unset); committed example is `false`; local `pnpm dev` HTTP via gitignored `.env.development.local` + `pnpm dev:api`; empty published catalog keeps live Home/Categories/Search chrome (Impl 196); catalog load-fail is not unpublished (Impl 198); Prisma Admin `CoinPackage` on catalog (Impl 201) — `wiki/conventions/portal-catalog-read.md`. Settings: mock fail-open; HTTP `GET /api/settings`; Prisma Admin `PlatformSettings` when persist is Prisma (Impl 200) — `wiki/conventions/portal-settings-read.md`. Auth: mock localStorage when unset; HTTP cookie session + profile writers when mock is off — `wiki/conventions/portal-auth-http.md`. Wallet: mock `softgate_wallet_v1` when unset; HTTP stub ledger + catalog strip when mock is off — `wiki/conventions/portal-wallet-http.md`. Library Subscribe/History/Likes: mock `softgate_library_v1` / `softgate_engage_v1`; HTTP cookie persist when mock is off — `wiki/conventions/portal-library-http.md`. Notifications inbox: mock `softgate_notifications_v1`; HTTP cookie persist when mock is off — `wiki/conventions/portal-notifications-http.md`. Admin service-token broadcast + Web Push + comment_reply email/push (Impl 203) and `new_episode` fan-out (Impl 204) — `wiki/conventions/portal-notifications-deliver.md`. Notif toggles + reader prefs: mock `softgate_notif_prefs_v1` / `softgate_reader_prefs_v1`; HTTP cookie persist when mock is off — `wiki/conventions/portal-prefs-http.md`. Comments: mock `softgate_comments_v1`; HTTP shared thread `GET/POST /api/comments` when mock is off — `wiki/conventions/portal-comments-http.md`. Named Prisma/R2/Brevo/VAPID slots; Prisma persist when `DATABASE_URL` is set; R2 put helper under `portal/` when core slots are set; Brevo HTML forgot/reset when key+from are set; leader-dev mapping (Impl 193); local Prisma URL + migrate once (Impl 194); Prisma catalog from Admin tables (Impl 195); Prisma PlatformSettings (Impl 200); Prisma CoinPackage (Impl 201); live join port split (Impl 202); Admin service token + VAPID (Impl 203); new-episode ping (Impl 204) — `wiki/conventions/named-integrations.md`. Git: `main` is product/Vercel; `development` is leader-dev integration (gitignored env only) — `wiki/02-workflow.md`.